We do not sell our products on Facebook because some products can be harmful to the skin if they are not used properly.
We need to check the customer skin problems and suggest the correct product for them to use individuals.
If our clients have any negative problems because they have purchased products online without consulting, we will risk our customer loss and reduce confidence in our product quality.
